;--------------------------------------------------
;マップの紹介文
;--------------------------------------------------
@マップ紹介_19
;とりあえず5行
SELECTCASE PlayerLandProgress
CASE 0
PRINTFORML A barren land that you bought.
PRINTFORML Who knows what you could do with this land. Its big enough to hold a luxurious compound.
CASE 1
PRINTFORML A shack built by %CALLNAME:PlayerLandOwner%.
PRINTFORML It only holds just %HIM_HER(PlayerLandOwner)%, but it has a lot of building potential.
CASE 2
PRINTFORML A basic worn-out house built by %CALLNAME:PlayerLandOwner%.
PRINTFORML There's a garden, bath, and general study areas. 
CASE 3
PRINTFORML A mid-level house built by %CALLNAME:PlayerLandOwner%.
PRINTFORML It's nice enough to be able to house another person as well.
CASE 4
PRINTFORML A large gated mansion built by %CALLNAME:PlayerLandOwner%.
PRINTFORML Houses up to five tenants comfortably, with several amenities and a spacious interior.
PRINTFORML A room can be converted into whatever the builder wants to have.
CASE 5
PRINTFORML A grand gated mansion built by %CALLNAME:PlayerLandOwner%.
PRINTFORML A luxurious compound with enough rooms to hold multiple families. 
PRINTFORML Furthermore, several rooms can be converted into whatever the builder wants to have.
ENDSELECT